data primitive_identity_d0_scope_note: String = "D0 is NOT terminal acceptance and does NOT close the subject universe. Landed and executing: join mechanism across five carriers, five refusal variants typed, three refusal detectors executing with witnesses (see primitive_d0_refusal_execution_note), derived census across four surfaces. OPEN at fifth surface (InterpreterDispatch): closure fires when interpreter-primitive-roster lands (primitive_interpreter_dispatch_derivation_next_trigger). Four-of-five derived is honest interim state, not completion."

data primitive_d0_refusal_execution_note: String = "Five PrimitiveJoinViolation variants typed at D0. Three detectors execute with RED witnesses: primitive_surface_missing_identity_violation, primitive_realization_unknown_primitive_violation, primitive_duplicate_semantic_definition_violation. Two scaffold detectors execute on planted inputs only (terminal join expands population-wide detection): primitive_surface_joins_two_identities_violation, primitive_incompatible_invocation_assignment_violation."

data primitive_identity_d0_note: String = "D0 (primitive-identity-join first slice): semantic primitive identity is ONE join key across five independently-writable surfaces. See primitive_identity_d0_scope_note — NOT the closing contract. primitive_surface_census_derived reads four live authorities. primitive_interpreter_dispatch_measurement_rows is an interim measurement scaffold, NOT an authority (see primitive_interpreter_dispatch_measurement_scaffold_note). Open denominator receipt: primitive_d0_open_denominator_receipt. Dissolve-on: feature:primitive-realization-single-authority."

data primitive_interpreter_dispatch_measurement_scaffold_note: String = "SCAFFOLD — interim measurement, NOT an authority: primitive_interpreter_dispatch_measurement_rows carries four join specimens with provenance MeasurementOnly. Dissolution trigger: interpreter-primitive-roster lands on clever-crab-111 v1 lane (interpreter_free_call_arm_spellings macro + six-site roster); primitive_surface_census_derived absorbs InterpreterDispatch; delete primitive_interpreter_dispatch_measurement_rows and this note."

data primitive_d0_derived_surface_drift_audit_note: String = "Derived-surface drift audit (review 45947 class): AlgebraTemplate — CLOSED, all_algebra_field_templates flat_maps all_algebra_profiles (2c9c01351). EmitHandler — single authority, rt_function_registry with derived rt_functions/rt_ref_map_functions projections (no parallel roster). BuiltinRegistry — OPEN parallel enumeration: builtin_registry_surface_names hand list beside builtin_function_registry Map (witness cannot map_keys Node at runtime; builtin_registry_surface_names_note). PrimitiveContractRow — OPEN parallel enumeration: primitive_contract_roster hand list beside *_contract data rows (primitive_contract_roster_note). D0 mutation control on those two surfaces discovers drift only when the hand list is updated, not when the primary authority grows alone."

data primitive_d0_open_denominator_receipt_note: String = "Typed located counted open denominator (rung-honesty receipt): derived_surface_authority_count=4 (BuiltinRegistry, PrimitiveContractRow, AlgebraTemplate, EmitHandler); open_surface_authority_count=1 (InterpreterDispatch at primitive_interpreter_dispatch_derivation_next_trigger); interpreter_dispatch_arm_count=158; interpreter_dispatch_spelling_count=169 across six v1_interpreter sites; interpreter_measurement_specimen_count=4 (NOT 158). derived_census_rows_missing_identity_count is measured live by primitive_d0_derived_rows_missing_identity_count — ranks join work remaining on derived surfaces. See primitive_d0_derived_surface_drift_audit_note for per-surface drift status."

data primitive_d0_derived_surface_authority_count: Int = 4

data primitive_d0_open_surface_authority_count: Int = 1

data primitive_interpreter_dispatch_arm_count: Int = 158

data primitive_interpreter_dispatch_spelling_count: Int = 169

data primitive_d0_parallel_roster_surface_authority_count: Int = 2

data primitive_d0_mutation_control_coverage_note: String = "Exact D1 mutation-control coverage after D0: DISCOVERED on AlgebraTemplate and EmitHandler — new template or emit-handler row without identity join appears on primitive_surface_census_derived and can refuse. PARTIAL on BuiltinRegistry and PrimitiveContractRow (parallel_roster_surface_authority_count=2) — mutation control fires when the hand roster (builtin_registry_surface_names, primitive_contract_roster) is updated, NOT when builtin_function_registry or a *_contract data row grows alone; see primitive_d0_derived_surface_drift_audit_note. NOT DISCOVERED on InterpreterDispatch — new arm on any of the six v1_interpreter dispatch sites is blind until primitive_interpreter_dispatch_derivation_next_trigger lands. Counted: open_surface_authority_count=1. Derived does not mean complete; parallel roster does not mean single-authority."

data primitive_interpreter_dispatch_six_sites_note: String = "Interpreter dispatch is SIX sites in v1_interpreter (clever-crab-111 census, parent-verified): eval_builtin_inner 112 arms/115 spellings free calls; eval_algebra_method_inner 39 arms/46 spellings methods; eval_call 2 arms fold_list and fold_list_right native intercept BEFORE eval_builtin_inner; try_v2_std_collection_map_primitive_grounding 2 arms; try_parse_table_memo_dispatch 2 arms; eval_method_call 1 arm lookup short-circuit. Total 158 arms / 169 spellings. D0 primitive_interpreter_dispatch_measurement_rows covers four join specimens only — NOT this six-site population. A census reading only eval_builtin_inner sees about two thirds."

data primitive_interpreter_dispatch_derivation_next_trigger: String = "Next rung trigger: land interpreter-primitive-roster — modeled roster authority for all six v1_interpreter dispatch sites. clever-crab-111 macro authority makes eval_builtin_inner arms and interpreter_free_call_arm_spellings roster unwritable-by-construction (arm without roster entry and roster entry without arm both refuse); other five sites are hand-declared rows with the macro as dissolution trigger. Coordinate roster shape with clever-crab before building join consumption. No roster row carries identity — arms that join to nothing stay representable for SurfaceMissingPrimitiveIdentity."

data primitive_interpreter_surface_unenumerable_finding_note: String = "Finding (inherits to v1 exit lane): the interpreter primitive surface was six hand-written Rust dispatch sites in v1_interpreter, not one. v1_interpreter eval_builtin_inner is the main free-call site. v2.compiler.eval v2_eval_call_primitive (carrier src/v2/compiler/05_eval.dag) is a separate v2 witness hook — real symbol, NOT v1 dispatch (§3 cite-the-symbol: never attribute it to v1_interpreter.rs). eval_call native intercept for fold_list fires before eval_builtin_inner — explains registry absence. clever-crab-111 macro authority may make eval_builtin_inner derivable sooner; five other sites remain hand-declared until macro dissolves them."

data primitive_fold_list_spelling_fork_note: String = "Named finding — SPELLING FORK, not alias: contract/algebra carry fold while interpreter/emit carry fold_list. Distinct from alias groups (length/count/size are one eval_builtin_inner arm with three spellings — aliases sharing an arm cannot disagree). fold and fold_list are separate surfaces that CAN disagree; fold_list additionally lives on eval_call intercept before eval_builtin_inner, so it never reaches builtin_function_registry."

data primitive_lookup_dual_realization_note: String = "Named finding — first two-realizations-one-name specimen: lookup has eval_method_call short-circuit AND an algebra template arm; the short-circuit shadows the algebra arm. Better join specimen than index_by for SurfaceJoinsTwoIdentities / realization reconciliation. keys and values DO have algebra template arms — determinism undetectability is about the lens view of unqualified symbols, not absence of algebra arms."

data primitive_interpreter_dispatch_derivation_blocked_note: String = "Interpreter dispatch derivation blocked pending primitive_interpreter_dispatch_derivation_next_trigger. Measurement rows use provenance MeasurementOnly and cover four join specimens only; see primitive_interpreter_dispatch_six_sites_note."

type PrimitiveIdentity {
  slug: NonEmptyStr
}

type PrimitiveSemanticContract {
  canonical_name: NonEmptyStr
}

type PrimitiveDefinition {
  identity: PrimitiveIdentity
  semantic_contract: PrimitiveSemanticContract
}

type InvocationForm
  = FreeCall
  | MethodCall { receiver_domain: NonEmptyStr }
  | OperatorCall

type PrimitiveInvocationSurface {
  primitive: PrimitiveIdentity
  form: InvocationForm
  authored_symbol: NonEmptyStr
}

type RealizationTarget
  = InterpreterHost
  | EmitRust
  | EmitTypeScript

type PrimitiveRealization {
  primitive: PrimitiveIdentity
  target: RealizationTarget
  handler: DeclarationRef
}

type PrimitiveCostFact {
  primitive: PrimitiveIdentity
  cost: CostShape
}

type TraversalOrder
  = HostUnspecifiedOrder
  | CanonicalOrder
  | SourcePreservingOrder
  | TraversalOrderUnclassified

type PrimitiveTraversalOrderFact {
  primitive: PrimitiveIdentity
  order: TraversalOrder
}

type PrimitiveSurfaceAuthority
  = BuiltinRegistry
  | PrimitiveContractRow
  | AlgebraTemplate
  | InterpreterDispatch
  | EmitHandler

type PrimitiveSurfaceCensusProvenance
  = DerivedFromAuthority
  | MeasurementOnly

type PrimitiveSurfaceRow {
  authority: PrimitiveSurfaceAuthority
  authored_symbol: NonEmptyStr
  authority_ref: DeclarationRef
  primitive: PrimitiveIdentity?
  provenance: PrimitiveSurfaceCensusProvenance
}

type PrimitiveJoinViolation
  = SurfaceMissingPrimitiveIdentity {
      authority: PrimitiveSurfaceAuthority
      authored_symbol: NonEmptyStr
    }
  | SurfaceJoinsTwoIdentities {
      authority: PrimitiveSurfaceAuthority
      authored_symbol: NonEmptyStr
      first: PrimitiveIdentity
      second: PrimitiveIdentity
    }
  | IncompatibleInvocationAssignment {
      authored_symbol: NonEmptyStr
      first: PrimitiveIdentity
      second: PrimitiveIdentity
    }
  | RealizationNamesUnknownPrimitive {
      target: RealizationTarget
      handler: DeclarationRef
    }
  | DuplicateSemanticDefinition { identity: PrimitiveIdentity }

fn primitive_identity_slug(name: String) -> PrimitiveIdentity {
  PrimitiveIdentity { slug: concat("primitive.", name) as NonEmptyStr }
}

fn primitive_identity_eq(left: PrimitiveIdentity, right: PrimitiveIdentity) -> Bool {
  left.slug == right.slug
}

data primitive_map_keys: PrimitiveIdentity = primitive_identity_slug(name: "map_keys")
data primitive_map_values: PrimitiveIdentity = primitive_identity_slug(name: "map_values")
data primitive_fold_list: PrimitiveIdentity = primitive_identity_slug(name: "fold_list")
data primitive_index_by: PrimitiveIdentity = primitive_identity_slug(name: "index_by")

data primitive_map_keys_definition: PrimitiveDefinition = PrimitiveDefinition {
  identity: primitive_map_keys,
  semantic_contract: PrimitiveSemanticContract { canonical_name: "map_keys" as NonEmptyStr },
}

data primitive_map_values_definition: PrimitiveDefinition = PrimitiveDefinition {
  identity: primitive_map_values,
  semantic_contract: PrimitiveSemanticContract { canonical_name: "map_values" as NonEmptyStr },
}

data primitive_fold_list_definition: PrimitiveDefinition = PrimitiveDefinition {
  identity: primitive_fold_list,
  semantic_contract: PrimitiveSemanticContract { canonical_name: "fold_list" as NonEmptyStr },
}

data primitive_index_by_definition: PrimitiveDefinition = PrimitiveDefinition {
  identity: primitive_index_by,
  semantic_contract: PrimitiveSemanticContract { canonical_name: "index_by" as NonEmptyStr },
}

data primitive_d0_definitions: List<PrimitiveDefinition> = [
  primitive_map_keys_definition,
  primitive_map_values_definition,
  primitive_fold_list_definition,
  primitive_index_by_definition,
]

fn surface_row(
  authority: PrimitiveSurfaceAuthority,
  authored_symbol: String,
  authority_ref: DeclarationRef,
  primitive: PrimitiveIdentity?,
  provenance: PrimitiveSurfaceCensusProvenance
) -> PrimitiveSurfaceRow {
  PrimitiveSurfaceRow {
    authority: authority,
    authored_symbol: authored_symbol as NonEmptyStr,
    authority_ref: authority_ref,
    primitive: primitive,
    provenance: provenance,
  }
}

type PrimitiveSurfaceAliasBinding {
  authority: PrimitiveSurfaceAuthority
  authored_symbol: NonEmptyStr
  identity: PrimitiveIdentity
}

data primitive_d0_surface_alias_bindings_note: String = "D0 specimen alias table — single (authority × authored_symbol) → PrimitiveIdentity authority consumed by primitive_identity_lookup and all census row builders. Dissolve-on: population-wide join replaces this hand table at terminal acceptance."

data primitive_d0_surface_alias_bindings: List<PrimitiveSurfaceAliasBinding> = [
  PrimitiveSurfaceAliasBinding {
    authority: BuiltinRegistry,
    authored_symbol: "map_keys" as NonEmptyStr,
    identity: primitive_map_keys,
  },
  PrimitiveSurfaceAliasBinding {
    authority: BuiltinRegistry,
    authored_symbol: "map_values" as NonEmptyStr,
    identity: primitive_map_values,
  },
  PrimitiveSurfaceAliasBinding {
